# STIG CNTR-K8-000900: The Kubernetes manifest files must have least privileges.
# STIG ID: V-242408 (MEDIUM)

META
    esp_id `k8s-cntr-k8-000900-apiserver-manifest-perms-001`
    version `1.0.0`
    dsl_schema_version `1.0.0`
    platform `kubernetes`
    criticality `high`

    title `STIG CNTR-K8-000900: The Kubernetes manifest files must have least privileges.`
    description `The Kubernetes manifest files must have least privileges.`
    author `example-security`
    tags `kubernetes,stig,disa-stig,permissions`

    control_mapping `DISA-STIG:CNTR-K8-000900,NIST-800-53:CM-5(6),NIST-800-53:CM-6`
    control_objective `CM-5(6)`

    assessment_method `TEST`
    implementation_status `implemented`
    responsible_role `system-admin`

    control_origination `sp-system`
    inherited_from `Kubernetes:cluster:k8s-hardening`
    customer_responsibility `configuration`

    remediation_days `30`
    recommendation `Review and remediate per DISA STIG guidance for CNTR-K8-000900.`

    component_id `comp-k8s-cluster`

    impl_CM_5_6 `This control is validated by checking the required Kubernetes configuration against the DISA STIG baseline.`

META_END

DEF
    OBJECT target
        path `/etc/kubernetes/manifests/kube-apiserver.yaml`
    OBJECT_END

    STATE meta_check
        exists boolean = true
        permissions string = `0644`
    STATE_END

    CRI AND
        CTN file_metadata
            TEST all all AND
            STATE_REF meta_check
            OBJECT_REF target
        CTN_END
    CRI_END
DEF_END
